<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom half-year net down.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom half-year net down.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Total revenues	19,616 vs 19,102</p>
<p>    Operating profit     8,471 vs  5,790</p>
<p>    Profit after tax     6,595 vs  8,888</p>
<p>    Cash dividend	 7.5 pct vs nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - full name is Pakistan Telecommunication Company Limited. The government holds majority shares after unloading 12 percent of the stocks to the general public. The government plans to privatise it but has not given any specific date.</p>
</text>
